 <h3><u>Aye maut theherja</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p dir=ltr>hichkiyan lete thay ali akbar umme laila ye bain karti thi<br> poshaak udhaloon ke mai armaan nikaloon<br> ay maut teher jaa ay maut teher jaa<br> mai apne jawan laal ko dulha to bana loon<br> ...ay maut</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>is laal ko mai kaise karoon tere hawale<br> ye chand to deta hai zamane ko ujale<br> is chand ki poshaak sitaron se sajaloon<br> ...ay maut</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>athara baras phoolon ki tarha jise paala<br> jaata hai mujhe chod ke wo gesuon wala<br> ab tu hi bata kaise mai is dil ko sambhaloon<br> ...ay maut</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>dekhe thay bahut khaab magar khaak hue sab<br> is bete ke sehre ki dua karti thi zainab<br> dulah na sahi mai ise dulah sa banaloon<br> ...ay maut</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>har shaam jise lagti hai ab shame gharibaan<br> jo kehti thi akbar ki dulhan laaungi amma<br> us fatima sughra ko madine se bulaloon<br> ...ay maut</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>qaime se zara door khade rote hai sarwar<br> ek haat kalaje pe hai ek haat kamar par<br> mai khud ko sambhaloon ke shahe deen ko sambhaloon<br> ...ay maut</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>ye kiski nazar kha gayi is noore nazar ko<br> veeran kiye jaate hai akbar mere ghar ko<br> jee karta hai is chaand ko dunya se chupaloon<br> ...ay maut</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>zainab ke labon par hai buka haaye muqaddar<br> kya sehra chadhaun mai teri lash pe akbar<br> aur khud ko teri laash pe sadqe hi utaroon<br> ...ay maut</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>mehendi na lagi haaton may hai khoon badan ka<br> pooshak-e-shahani ko mila daag kafan ka<br> is laash pe athaarveen mannat ko badhaloon<br> ...ay maut</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>taqdeer kisi maa ko ye manzar na dikhaaye<br> maiyat pe jawaan laal ke wo ashq bahaaye<br> jee bhar ke ise dekhloon aur ashq bahaun<br> ...ay maut</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>faryaad zara sunle sakina ki zubaani<br> marjaungi bichda jo mera yousuf-e-saani<br> bhaiya mere naraaz hai mai unko manaloon<br> ...ay maut</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>maa roti rahi mazhar-o-irfan tadapkar<br> aur aakhri hichki may safar kargaye akbar<br> maa kehti rahi mai ise dulah to banaloon<br> ...ay maut</p> 
